sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client (flows.py)
    participant CatC as Catalyst Center<br/>(mock :8147)
    Client->>+CatC: POST /dna/intent/api/v1/network-device-poller/cli/read-request<br/>{"commands": ["show version"], "deviceUuids": ["dev-1"]}
    CatC-->>-Client: 202 Accepted {"taskId": "task-001"}
    Note over Client,CatC: 202 = queued, NOT done. CatC works on the job in the background.
    loop every 0.2 s until endTime is set (real run: 3 polls)
        Client->>CatC: GET /dna/intent/api/v1/task/task-001
        alt still running
            CatC-->>Client: 200 OK isError=false, no endTime yet
        else finished
            CatC-->>Client: 200 OK isError=false, endTime set, progress={"fileId": "file-001"}
        end
    end
    Client->>CatC: GET /dna/intent/api/v1/file/file-001
    CatC-->>Client: 200 OK SUCCESS: show version
